WEBVTT

00:08:59.208 --> 00:09:00.559
You --

00:09:00.583 --> 00:09:02.851
if you have some consciousness

00:09:02.875 --> 00:09:04.643
and you want to bring some practice,

00:09:04.667 --> 00:09:07.934
if you want to step
into that warrior space

00:09:07.958 --> 00:09:09.768
around your how --

00:09:09.792 --> 00:09:14.934
how you express
in every aspect of your life --

00:09:14.958 --> 00:09:19.851
then you get to be the artist
of that expression.

00:09:19.875 --> 00:09:25.476
You get to step into that and claim it

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:27.059
and exercise it

00:09:27.083 --> 00:09:32.768
and bring that beingness
through your doingness